f=\"https://ntodaynews.com/\">Website</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/156vzUPBsQ/\">Facebook</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ntoday_news?utm_source=qr&amp;igsh=bHp0M2x5dTIydXYy\">Instagram</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://youtube.com/@ntodaynews?si=XcGJOnHJ2MGzT0MF\">YouTube</a>', 'మహిళ పరిస్థితి విషమం', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3820-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-12-29 09:46:52', '2025-12-29 04:16:52', '', 3820, 'https://ntodaynews.com/?p=3824', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
